        "name": "Verdict · passive",
        "source": "Weapon",
        "category": "weapon",
        "defaultEnabled": true,
        "description": "Increases ATK by 20%/25%/30%/35%/40%. When party members obtain Elemental Shards from Crystallize or trigger Lunar-Crystallize reactions, the equipping character will gain 1 Seal, increasing Elemental Skill DMG by 18%/22.5%/27%/31.5%/36%. The Seal lasts for 15s, and the equipper may have up to 2 Seals at once. All of the equipper's Seals will disappear 0.2s after their Elemental Skill deals DMG. Up to 1 Seal may be obtained every second through the Lunar-Crystallize reaction. Combat snapshot: set the controls for this hit; durations, stack consumption, healing, energy and cooldowns are not simulated.",
